OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after teen seriously
OL,4,Ainjured in stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 18-year-old man has been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of attempted murder after a
OL,8,Fteenager was seriously injured in a
OL,9,Fstabbing.
OL,11,FWarwickshire Police said the incident
OL,12,Fhappened near the bandstand in the Pump
OL,13,FRoom Gardens, Leamington Spa, at about
OL,14,F22:25 BST on Friday.
OL,16,FA 16-year-old boy was also arrested on
OL,17,Fsuspicion of affray in relation to the
OL,18,Fincident, officers said.
OL,20,FThe teenager remains in hospital in a
OL,21,Fstable condition after sustaining an
OL,22,Finjury to his chest.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
